{
  "$Comment": [
    "The base of every boss fight in this pack, run by the game's own encounter scripts. It is",
    "Abstract, so it never runs on its own: a boss is a Variant of it (Type Variant, Reference",
    "Orbis_Boss_Encounter_Template) that names its marker, its roles' group, its bar, its music, its",
    "health steps, its two Claims and up to three phases. The shape is the game's own phased boss",
    "(Example_Macro_Slot_Boss): each phase has a behavior slot (what happens while it runs) and the",
    "next has a transition slot (when it starts), filled by macros, with _ForwardedModifiers handing",
    "each macro its settings.",
    "",
    "In order. A Player sensor keeps the fight's members (the library credits and pays from them).",
    "Intro raises the boss from SpawnMarker once a player comes within SummonPlayerRange, binds him",
    "into the Boss slot, puts on one health step per player beyond the first (up to five) and refills",
    "him, then makes him vulnerable, puts up the bar and the music, tells the library zc:engaged and",
    "moves to Phase_1. Away from his arena's prefab (a console spawn on a bare world) no marker is in",
    "reach, so after two and a half seconds the plain Spawn action raises FallbackRole beside the",
    "script and the BossGroups sensor binds him the same way. Each phase keeps the boss bound through",
    "a form change, runs its behavior, watches for the next phase, and ends the fight when no boss of",
    "BossGroups is left alive in reach: the bar comes down, zc:defeated goes out and Complete pays",
    "the two Claims (each player's first win of the day; see the Rewards files), plays the music's",
    "ending, sends zc:reset and rests in Done. A fresh copy of the arena brings a fresh fight.",
    "With HealthPacks true, the game's health packs drop on the arena's tagged points from the",
    "fight's start to the win, the way its Feastmaster's do (Macro_Health_Pack_Spawn, every",
    "HealthPackInterval seconds); the points come with the arena's prefab.",
    "",
    "A wipe (every player down) or an arena left empty for EmptyArenaSeconds resets it: Resetting",
    "clears the bar, removes everything in SweepGroups (heads, adds) and runs the boss's",
    "ResetBehavior, the game's own arena reset removes the boss once nobody watches from the death",
    "screen, and only then, back in Intro, the library hears zc:reset (sent any earlier, the library",
    "would bind the departing boss again before he is gone). Intro waits for players to come back.",
    "",
    "Every parameter's default names the Headless Horseman's own ids, so a new boss's Variant overrides",
    "every one of them. Keep a Variant's file name off every role's: a script and a role share one id",
    "namespace."
  ],
  "Class": "EncounterManager",
  "Type": "Abstract",
  "StartState": "Intro",
  "CleanupOnRemove": true,
  "Parameters": {
    "SpawnMarker": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman_Marker",
      "Description": "The manual spawn marker standing in the arena's prefab that raises the boss."
    },
    "FallbackRole": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman_Mounted",
      "Description": "The role raised beside the script with the plain Spawn action when no marker is in reach."
    },
    "BossGroups": {
      "Value": [ "Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman_Group" ],
      "TypeHint": "String",
      "Description": "NPC groups holding the boss in every form, so a form change keeps him bound and a reset clears him."
    },
    "SweepGroups": {
      "Value": [ "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Head_Group", "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Adds_Group" ],
      "TypeHint": "String",
      "Description": "NPC groups of everything else the fight raised, removed from the arena when it resets."
    },
    "SummonRange": {
      "Value": 30,
      "Description": "How far from the script's entity a spawn marker may stand to be fired."
    },
    "SummonPlayerRange": {
      "Value": 30,
      "Description": "How close a player must come to the script's entity before the boss rises."
    },
    "ArenaRange": {
      "Value": 45,
      "Description": "How far from the script's entity a player counts as in the fight (members, health steps, wipes)."
    },
    "CorpseRange": {
      "Value": 55,
      "Description": "How far the wipe check looks for a fallen player. Wider than ArenaRange."
    },
    "EmptyArenaSeconds": {
      "Value": [ 15, 15 ],
      "Description": "Seconds the arena must hold no living player before the fight resets."
    },
    "TargetRange": {
      "Value": 80,
      "Description": "How far the boss may roam and still be held in the fight. Cover the whole arena."
    },
    "BossBarName": {
      "Value": "npcs.Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman.name",
      "Description": "The lang key the boss bar shows, resolved on each player's own client."
    },
    "BossBarHardMode": {
      "Value": false,
      "Description": "True marks the boss bar as a hard fight, the game's own hard-mode bar. A hard Variant of a boss sets it."
    },
    "Music": {
      "Value": "Track_Z1D_Goblin_Boss",
      "Description": "The MusicContainer started for every member as the fight begins."
    },
    "MusicPhaseState": {
      "Value": "AudioState_Goblin_Boss_Phase",
      "Description": "The music's phase axis: set to Phase1 as the fight begins and Ending at the win."
    },
    "ScaleP2Effect": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Scale_Health_P2",
      "Description": "Health step put on the boss with 2 or more players in the arena."
    },
    "ScaleP3Effect": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Scale_Health_P3",
      "Description": "Health step put on the boss with 3 or more players in the arena."
    },
    "ScaleP4Effect": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Scale_Health_P4",
      "Description": "Health step put on the boss with 4 or more players in the arena."
    },
    "ScaleP5Effect": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Scale_Health_P5",
      "Description": "Health step put on the boss with 5 or more players in the arena."
    },
    "TopUpEffect": {
      "Value": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Scale_TopUp",
      "Description": "Refills the boss to his raised maximum before the fight begins."
    },
    "ScalePlayerRange": {
      "Value": [ 0, 45 ],
      "Description": "The distance band from the script's entity in which players are counted for the health steps."
    },
    "DailyReward": {
      "Value": "",
      "Description": "The ZigClaim reward each credited player is paid at the win (Server/Rewards). Empty pays none."
    },
    "ChaseReward": {
      "Value": "",
      "Description": "A second ZigClaim reward paid at the win, such as a chase table. Empty pays none."
    },
    "VictorySeconds": {
      "Value": [ 12, 12 ],
      "Description": "Seconds the music's ending plays after the win before the fight closes."
    },
    "HealthPacks": {
      "Value": false,
      "Description": "True drops the game's health packs (the Feastmaster's pickups) on the arena's tagged points from the fight's start until the win or a reset. A player who walks into one heals."
    },
    "HealthPackTag": {
      "Value": "Orbis_Boss_Health_Pack",
      "Description": "The point tag the arena's prefab carries wherever a health pack may drop (its points, written by tools/arena_markers.py)."
    },
    "HealthPackRange": {
      "Value": 45,
      "Description": "How far from the script's entity the tagged points are looked for."
    },
    "HealthPackInteraction": {
      "Value": "Root_Health_Pack_Spawn",
      "Description": "The root interaction run at a chosen point: the game's own health pack, which falls to the ground there and waits 20 seconds for a player."
    },
    "HealthPackInterval": {
      "Value": [ 40, 90 ],
      "Description": "Seconds between drops, rolled each time; the first comes one full interval after the fight begins. The Feastmaster's own is 40 to 90."
    },
    "HealthPackSpawnCount": {
      "Value": [ 1, 1 ],
      "Description": "How many tagged points get a pack each time, rolled each time."
    },
    "Phase1Behavior": {
      "Value": "$Null",
      "Description": "Macro run while phase 1 lasts, or $Null for none."
    },
    "Phase2Transition": {
      "Value": "Encounter_Macro_Transition_TargetInHealthRange",
      "Description": "Macro that moves the fight to phase 2. A fight with fewer phases forwards it a HealthRange of [0, 0], so it never fires before the boss falls."
    },
    "Phase2Behavior": {
      "Value": "$Null",
      "Description": "Macro run while phase 2 lasts, or $Null for none."
    },
    "Phase3Transition": {
      "Value": "Encounter_Macro_Transition_TargetInHealthRange",
      "Description": "Macro that moves the fight to phase 3. A fight with fewer phases forwards it a HealthRange of [0, 0], so it never fires before the boss falls."
    },
    "Phase3Behavior": {
      "Value": "$Null",
      "Description": "Macro run while phase 3 lasts, or $Null for none."
    },
    "ResetBehavior": {
      "Value": "$Null",
      "Description": "Macro run while the fight resets, to clear the boss's own flags and slots, or $Null for none."
    }
  },
  "Instructions": [
    {
      "$Comment": "Keeps the fight's members: the library credits and pays from them.",
      "Continue": true,
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "Player",
        "Range": { "Compute": "ArenaRange" },
        "Collector": {
          "Type": "EncounterMembers"
        }
      },
      "Actions": [
        {
          "Type": "Nothing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$Comment": "Health packs, the Feastmaster's way: while Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Active is set (the fight's start sets it when HealthPacks is true; the win and a reset clear it), a pack drops on a random point tagged HealthPackTag every HealthPackInterval seconds.",
      "Reference": "Macro_Health_Pack_Spawn",
      "Modify": {
        "FlagName": "Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Active",
        "RunningFlag": "Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Running",
        "SpawnTimer": "Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Timer",
        "Tag": { "Compute": "HealthPackTag" },
        "Range": { "Compute": "HealthPackRange" },
        "Interaction": { "Compute": "HealthPackInteraction" },
        "Interval": { "Compute": "HealthPackInterval" },
        "SpawnCount": { "Compute": "HealthPackSpawnCount" }
      }
    },
    {
      "Reference": "Encounter_Macro_Reset_Arena",
      "Modify": {
        "_ExportStates": [ "Resetting", "Intro" ],
        "LiveFlag": "Orbis_Boss_Live",
        "Slot": "Boss",
        "SlotRange": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
        "BeaconRange": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
        "RemoveGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
        "RemoveRadius": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
        "ArenaRange": { "Compute": "ArenaRange" },
        "CorpseRange": { "Compute": "CorpseRange" },
        "ResetOnEmptyArena": true,
        "EmptyArenaSeconds": { "Compute": "EmptyArenaSeconds" },
        "ResetTag": "Orbis_Boss_Arena_Reset",
        "StopMusic": true,
        "ClearWeather": false
      }
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Resetting"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "$Comment": "Once per reset: the bar comes down, and zc:reset is owed to the library once the boss is gone (Intro sends it).",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Flag",
            "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Sent",
            "Set": false
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "ClearEncounterBossBar"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Owed"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Sent"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling",
              "SetTo": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Active",
              "SetTo": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "Removes everything else the fight raised.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Mob",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
            "MultiTarget": true,
            "Filters": [
              {
                "Type": "NPCGroup",
                "IncludeGroups": { "Compute": "SweepGroups" }
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "ForEach",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Type": "Remove",
                  "UseTarget": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "ResetBehavior" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Behavior" ],
          "AcceptsForward": true,
          "Nullable": true
        },
        {
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Any"
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Nothing"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Intro"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "$Comment": "Back from a reset, with the arena's boss removed: now the library hears zc:reset, once.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Flag",
            "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Owed"
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:reset"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Owed",
              "SetTo": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "Binds a boss of BossGroups into the Boss slot: the one the Spawn fallback raised, or the marker's.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Mob",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
            "LockOnTarget": true,
            "LockedTargetSlot": "Boss",
            "Rebind": true,
            "Filters": [
              {
                "Type": "NPCGroup",
                "IncludeGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" }
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Nothing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "Raises the boss from the marker once a player comes near.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "And",
            "Sensors": [
              {
                "Type": "Not",
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "Target",
                  "TargetSlot": "Boss",
                  "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
                }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Player",
                "Range": { "Compute": "SummonPlayerRange" }
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "TriggerSpawners",
              "Count": 1,
              "Range": { "Compute": "SummonRange" },
              "SpawnMarker": { "Compute": "SpawnMarker" },
              "TargetSlot": "Boss",
              "Rebind": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Goblin_Gobliterator_Scale_Health",
          "Modify": {
            "Effect": { "Compute": "ScaleP2Effect" },
            "PlayerCount": [ 2, 99 ],
            "PlayerRange": { "Compute": "ScalePlayerRange" },
            "Slot": "Boss",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Goblin_Gobliterator_Scale_Health",
          "Modify": {
            "Effect": { "Compute": "ScaleP3Effect" },
            "PlayerCount": [ 3, 99 ],
            "PlayerRange": { "Compute": "ScalePlayerRange" },
            "Slot": "Boss",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Goblin_Gobliterator_Scale_Health",
          "Modify": {
            "Effect": { "Compute": "ScaleP4Effect" },
            "PlayerCount": [ 4, 99 ],
            "PlayerRange": { "Compute": "ScalePlayerRange" },
            "Slot": "Boss",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Goblin_Gobliterator_Scale_Health",
          "Modify": {
            "Effect": { "Compute": "ScaleP5Effect" },
            "PlayerCount": [ 5, 99 ],
            "PlayerRange": { "Compute": "ScalePlayerRange" },
            "Slot": "Boss",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "No boss bound: any settle already started is dropped, so the next boss settles from the start.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "And",
            "Sensors": [
              {
                "Type": "Not",
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "Target",
                  "TargetSlot": "Boss",
                  "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
                }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Flag",
                "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling"
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling",
              "SetTo": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "Once the boss is bound, a one-second settle, so his health steps and the refill land before the fight checks he is at full health.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "And",
            "Sensors": [
              {
                "Type": "Target",
                "TargetSlot": "Boss",
                "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Flag",
                "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling",
                "Set": false
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling"
            },
            {
              "Type": "TimerStart",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settle",
              "StartValueRange": [ 1, 1 ],
              "RestartValueRange": [ 1, 1 ],
              "Repeating": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "TimerRestart",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settle"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "Refills the boss while his health is below its (raised) maximum.",
          "Continue": true,
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "Target",
            "TargetSlot": "Boss",
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
            "Filters": [
              {
                "Type": "Stat",
                "StatTarget": "Value",
                "RelativeTo": "Health",
                "Stat": "Health",
                "RelativeToTarget": "Max",
                "ValueRange": [ 0, 0.999 ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "ApplyEntityEffect",
              "EntityEffect": { "Compute": "TopUpEffect" },
              "UseTarget": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "The boss is bound and settled, at full health, with a player near: the fight begins.",
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "And",
            "Sensors": [
              {
                "Type": "Target",
                "TargetSlot": "Boss",
                "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
                "Filters": [
                  {
                    "Type": "Stat",
                    "StatTarget": "Value",
                    "RelativeTo": "Health",
                    "Stat": "Health",
                    "RelativeToTarget": "Max",
                    "ValueRange": [ 0.999, 1 ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "Type": "Player",
                "Range": { "Compute": "SummonPlayerRange" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Flag",
                "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling"
              },
              {
                "Type": "Timer",
                "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settle",
                "State": "Stopped"
              }
            ]
          },
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "SetTargetNPCInvulnerable",
              "Invulnerable": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Settling",
              "SetTo": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetEncounterBossBar",
              "Name": { "Compute": "BossBarName" },
              "HardMode": { "Compute": "BossBarHardMode" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "StartEncounterMusic",
              "MusicContainer": { "Compute": "Music" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetEncounterAudioState",
              "AudioState": { "Compute": "MusicPhaseState" },
              "Value": "Phase1"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Live"
            },
            {
              "Enabled": { "Compute": "HealthPacks" },
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_HealthPack_Active"
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Name": "Orbis_Boss_Reset_Sent",
              "SetTo": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
              "SignalId": "zc:engaged"
            },
            {
              "Type": "State",
              "State": "Phase_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "$Comment": "No marker in reach: after a short wait, raise the boss beside the script instead.",
          "Sensor": {
            "Type": "And",
            "Sensors": [
              {
                "Type": "Not",
                "Sensor": {
                  "Type": "Target",
                  "TargetSlot": "Boss",
                  "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
                }
              },
              {
                "Type": "Player",
                "Range": { "Compute": "SummonPlayerRange" }
              }
            ]
          },
          "ActionsBlocking": true,
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 2.5, 2.5 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Spawn",
              "Kind": { "Compute": "FallbackRole" },
              "SpawnAngle": 360,
              "DistanceRange": [ 4, 6 ],
              "CountRange": [ 1, 1 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Timeout",
              "Delay": [ 5, 5 ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Phase_1"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Orbis_Boss_Hold",
          "Modify": {
            "BossGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "Phase1Behavior" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Behavior" ],
          "AcceptsForward": true,
          "Nullable": true
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "Phase2Transition" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Transition" ],
          "AcceptsForward": true,
          "Modify": {
            "_ExportStates": [ "Phase_2" ]
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Orbis_Boss_Defeat",
          "Modify": {
            "_ExportStates": [ "Complete" ],
            "BossGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
            "MusicPhaseState": { "Compute": "MusicPhaseState" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Phase_2"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Orbis_Boss_Hold",
          "Modify": {
            "BossGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "Phase2Behavior" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Behavior" ],
          "AcceptsForward": true,
          "Nullable": true
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "Phase3Transition" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Transition" ],
          "AcceptsForward": true,
          "Modify": {
            "_ExportStates": [ "Phase_3" ]
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Orbis_Boss_Defeat",
          "Modify": {
            "_ExportStates": [ "Complete" ],
            "BossGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" },
            "MusicPhaseState": { "Compute": "MusicPhaseState" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sensor": {
        "Type": "State",
        "State": "Phase_3"
      },
      "Instructions": [
        {
          "Reference": "Macro_Orbis_Boss_Hold",
          "Modify": {
            "BossGroups": { "Compute": "BossGroups" },
            "Range": { "Compute": "TargetRange" }
          }
        },
        {
          "Reference": { "Compute": "Phase3Behavior" },
          "Interfaces": [ "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Behavior" ],
